{"stage": "sc", "served_model": "gpt-4.1-2025-04-14", "status": "completed", "usage": {"input_tokens": 1693, "input_tokens_details": {"cache_write_tokens": 0, "cached_tokens": 0, "cache_write_tokens_details": {"ttl_12h_tokens": 0, "ttl_30m_tokens": 0}}, "output_tokens": 653, "output_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0}, "total_tokens": 2346}, "output": [{"id": "msg_0c6990e772df4910006afcf26c653887d0879534a1b49092dc", "content": [{"annotations": [], "text": "## Evaluation and Recommendation\n\n### Goal: Achieve the best possible time resolution.\n\n### Constraint Review\n\n1. **Gas mixture must be one of the three candidates**\n   - All three (G1, G2, G3) are available and compatible.\n\n2. **Gas system must comply with environmental and safety policies**\n   - 90% recirculation planned for all mixtures (environmental concern addressed).\n\n3. **Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm**\n   - All tested gaps fall within the range.\n\n4. **Submit one recommended mixture and gas gap**\n   - Below is the final comparison.\n\n---\n\n### Simulation: Time Resolution Results (ns)\n\n| Gap (mm) | Mixture-G3 | Mixture-G1 | Mixture-G2 |\n|----------|------------|------------|------------|\n|   1.0    |   1.06     |   1.51     |   2.31     |\n|   2.0    |   0.86     |   1.33     |   1.98     |\n|   3.0    |   1.09     |   1.52     |   2.38     |\n\n**Best result:** Mixture-G3 at 2.0 mm gap (0.86 ns)\n\n---\n\n### Justification\n\n- **Performance:** Mixture-G3 with a 2.0 mm gap achieves the superior time resolution.\n- **Environmental/safety:** Recirculation and supply are confirmed for Mixture-G3; no extra risks relative to other options.\n- **Technical compatibility:** HV system and QA processes compatible.\n- **Availability:** Suppliers confirmed for all candidates.\n\n**Conclusion:** Mixture-G3 with a 2.0 mm gas gap is the optimal and compliant choice.\n\n---\n\nSubmitting the final recommendation.", "type": "output_text", "logprobs": []}], "role": "assistant", "status": "completed", "type": "message", "phase": null}, {"arguments": "{\"option\":\"Mixture-G3\",\"gap_mm\":2.0,\"justification\":\"Mixture-G3 at 2.0 mm gap achieves the best time resolution (0.86 ns) among all tested combinations. It complies with environmental/safety requirements due to the planned closed-loop gas recirculation, is available from suppliers, and is compatible with the high-voltage and QA systems. All project requirements are satisfied.\",\"requirements\":[{\"requirement\":\"The mixture must be one of the three candidates listed in candidate_specs.md.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Mixture-G3 is explicitly listed as a candidate in candidate_specs.md.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The gas system must comply with the laboratory's environmental and safety policies.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"All mixtures will use a closed-loop recirculation system with 90% recovery, minimizing emissions.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Gas gap between 1 and 3 mm.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Gap of 2.0 mm is within the allowed 1-3 mm range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the best possible time resolution.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Simulation shows Mixture-G3 at 2.0 mm achieves the best time resolution (0.86 ns) among all options.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_ZhnNvgBFdS2hz3JFGC2jjjuN", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0c6990e772df4910006afcf26e81c087d098a390eb77e4ab30", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
